<view class="page trip-page"><view class="chapter-heading"><text class="chapter-seal">行程</text><view><text class="eyebrow">宜昌旅行顾问</text><text class="page-title">定制宜昌行程</text></view></view><text class="disclaimer">内容仅供出行参考，请以景区、交通等官方公告为准</text><text class="budget-note">预算为全团总预算，不含往返宜昌大交通。</text><view class="form-card card"><label class="field"><text>目的地</text><input value="{{form.destination}}" placeholder="如：宜昌城区、三峡大坝" bindinput="onDestination" /></label><label class="field"><text>人数</text><input type="number" value="{{form.people}}" placeholder="1–20 人" bindinput="onPeople" /></label><label class="field"><text>总预算（元）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.totalBudgetCny}}" placeholder="1–100000" bindinput="onBudget" /></label><label class="field"><text>天数</text><input type="number" value="{{form.days}}" placeholder="1–7 天" bindinput="onDays" /></label><view class="field"><text>旅行偏好（最多 6 项）</text><view class="preference-list"><button wx:for="{{preferenceOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="preference {{form.preferences.includes(item) ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="onTogglePreference">{{item}}</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{errors.length}}" class="validation-errors"><text wx:for="{{errors}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{isSubmitting}}" class="waiting"><text>正在生成行程建议，请稍候…</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-panel"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="button-secondary retry-button" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{results.length}}" class="answer-list"><view wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="requestId" class="answer-wrap"><message-bubble role="assistant" content="{{item.answer}}" mode="{{item.mode}}" label="模拟回答，仅用于交互测试" /><source-card facts="{{item.localFacts}}" references="{{item.references}}" /></view></view><view wx:if="{{results.length}}" class="adjustment-card card"><label class="adjustment-field"><text>对行程还有什么想调整的？</text><textarea value="{{adjustment}}" maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如：第二天安排轻松一些" bindinput="onAdjustment" /></label><text wx:if="{{adjustmentError}}" class="adjustment-error">{{adjustmentError}}</text><button class="button-primary adjustment-button" loading="{{isSubmitting}}" disabled="{{isSubmitting}}" bindtap="submitAdjustment">发送调整</button><button class="button-secondary restart-button" disabled="{{isSubmitting}}" bindtap="restartTrip">重新规划</button></view><button class="button-primary submit-button" loading="{{isSubmitting}}" disabled="{{isSubmitting}}" bindtap="submit">生成行程</button></view>
